  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ocean Decade Coordination Office for Ocean Data Sharing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Decade Coordination Office (DCO) for Ocean Data Sharing was established in July 2023 to coordinate the implementation of the Ocean Decade Data and Information Strategy published in April 2023. In collaboration with data contributors, this office will contribute to sustainable change by bringing together existing infrastructures, coordinating the development of technical and human capacities, as well as identifying data gaps to be filled. The goal of this project is to provide support to the DCO to implement this strategy through financial assistance. The proposed project would be implemented over 24 months by the Decade Coordination Unit of the IOC in close collaboration with IODE.</narrative>
  </description>
